{%- comment -%}
  SAFETY & INTERACTION CHECK — signature feature.

  Helbrede's own descriptions already carry precise interaction warnings
  ("may interact with medicines for diabetes and blood pressure, thyroid
  medicines, sedatives..."). Kapiva buries this class of information. Here the
  buyer declares their situation and the relevant lines from THIS product's own
  safety text are surfaced before they add to cart.

  Matching happens client-side against the product's real safety copy — nothing
  is generated, and if nothing matches it says so rather than inventing comfort.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign lines = product.hb.safety -%}
{%- if lines.size > 0 -%}
<section class="sec" id="safety" data-reveal>
  <div class="wrap split">

    <div>
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="sec-head__pre">before you buy</span>
        <h2 class="sec-head__main">Check it against you</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="t-lede">
        Supplements interact with medicines and conditions. Tell us what applies
        to you and we will pull the relevant warnings out of this product’s own
        safety information — before it goes in your cart, not after.
      </p>

      <div class="safety-chk" data-safety data-lines='{{ lines | json }}'>
        <div class="safety-chk__chips" role="group" aria-label="What applies to you">
          {%- assign conds = "Pregnant or breastfeeding|Thyroid condition|Diabetes medication|Blood pressure medication|Sedatives or sleep aids|Under 18|Surgery scheduled" | split: "|" -%}
          {%- for c in conds -%}
            <button class="chip safety-chk__chip" type="button" data-cond="{{ c }}" aria-pressed="false">
              <span class="chip__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ c }}
            </button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        <div class="safety-chk__out" data-safety-out hidden></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="panel panel--tint">
        <h3 class="pdp__block-h">Safety information</h3>
        <ul class="safety-list">
          {%- for l in lines -%}<li>{{ l }}</li>{%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
        <p class="t-sm t-dim-3" style="margin-top:1rem">
          Not for medicinal use. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat,
          cure or prevent any disease. Consult a qualified healthcare professional
          if you are unsure.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}
{% schema %}
{ "name": "Product — safety check", "settings": [] }
{% endschema %}
